Vijaya Diagnostic Centre is witnessing strong buying interest as the stock has broken out above the crucial Rs 1,550 resistance zone, marking a fresh all-time high. The stock continues to maintain a strong higher high-higher low structure and is trading comfortably above its key moving averages, reflecting a robust uptrend.
